---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftFabricationAgreement
---
Construct a FabricationAgreement draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Present drawings or structured specifications, finish samples, assumptions, and acceptance criteria for customer confirmation. Bind the quote to the accepted revision, then create production work only after material scope and commercial terms are approved.
